# Security headers for Workers-asset-layer responses (favicon, security.txt,
# icons...) which bypass next.config headers(). ZAP 10035/10021. The _headers
# file itself is never served (Workers Static Assets convention).
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload

# Content-hashed build output: cache for a year. @opennextjs/cloudflare does NOT add
# this itself once the app ships its own _headers (only `opennextjs-cloudflare migrate`
# writes it), so before this every JS / CSS / font on the Worker answered
# `cache-control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate` and a repeat visit revalidated
# each one (docs/RULINGS.md PERF-STORE-5).
/_next/static/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
